Statement of modification
-------------------------

  donor.py is an UNMODIFIED, byte-for-byte copy of the file named above. Its
  sha256 is asserted against the imported snapshot by
  tests/test_dqn_market_scorer.py, so any edit to it fails the test suite.

  market_exec.py IS A MODIFIED DERIVATIVE of the `_market_actions` function in
  that file (donor.py:1706-1931). The derivative work by this repository's
  authors consists of threading a learned `MarketModifier` and a learned
  per-product sell reserve through the otherwise unchanged decision rules:

    - the sell loop retains `reserves[item]` units before sizing the sale,
      and skips the retention while liquidating;
    - `_seed_needs` counts are scaled by `modifier.seed_scale`;
    - `_target_hands` is offset by `modifier.hand_delta`;
    - the animal-purchase gate is overridden by `modifier.animal_gate`;
    - the land-purchase day gate is shifted by `modifier.land_bias`;
    - `FEED_STOCK_DAYS` is replaced by `modifier.feed_days` when sizing the
      wheat feed buy;
    - the seed and operating cash reserves are scaled by `modifier.cash_floor`.

  Every other file in this directory is original work of this repository.

  The field policy (`_role_plan`, `_unit_actions`) is used unmodified from
  donor.py. Only the market layer is learned.
